      "message": "The results for different resolutions are as follows:\n```\n           Encoder Instruction                     BD-Rate Loss(%)\ncpu   Resolution Count Reduction(%)   avg.psnr  ovr.psnr  ssim     vmaf    vmaf_neg\n4     LOWRES2       1.52              0.0745    0.0498    0.0647   0.0161   0.0353\n4     MIDRES2       1.71              0.052     0.0002    0.0284   0.06     0.0599\n4     SHORTS608p    1.89              0.1177    0.0823    0.0887   0.0334  -0.002\n4     SHORTS720p    0.39             -0.0257   -0.0256   -0.08     0.0564   0.0224\n4     SHORTS1080p   2.30             -0.0054   -0.0183    0.0191   0.0635   0.0249\n4     HDRES2        1.72              0.0343    0.0177   -0.0479  -0.0313  -0.0523\n4     Average       1.58              0.0401    0.0172    0.0119   0.0346   0.0147\n```\n\nThe instruction count reduction specified has been measured using command:\n```\n$ perf stat -e instructions:u ./aomenc\n```\nFor 608p and 720p shorts, a slightly higher BD-RATE loss in terms of avg.psnr and vmaf is observed.\n\nPlease review.",
